/*
  SlideRenderer.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0066 · SlideRenderer (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SlideRenderer` resolves (table "SlideRenderer") lives here with its English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own
  strings without editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the EXACT set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/analytics/components/review/SlideRenderer.tsx → the two drive-highlight labels
  it owns). The `slideRenderer.*` keys back this surface's own composition: the built-in
  default slide bodies (shown until the parent injects the richer child surfaces) and the
  native live-state chrome (freshness chip, banners, loading / empty / error, refresh /
  retry, accessibility copy).
*/

